{
 "about": [
  "Shared test vectors for the Track format. One row per Session.",
  "Dart encodes, Kotlin encodes, Python inspects. Vectors keep three from drifting.",
  "All coordinates are synthetic fixtures for codec tests, not real positions.",
  "Precision: lat/lon 1e-5 deg, time 1 ms delta, speed 0.1 km/h, altitude 0.1 m delta, polyline 1e5.",
  "Version 1 only. Decoder refuses unknown version.",
  "Simplification is Douglas-Peucker at 10.0 m, never dropping first, last, or protected.",
  "A point is protected when its own flag is set or the protected array marks its index.",
  "The two are a union: the array never disarms a flag the point carries.",
  "simplified_expected and simplified_piecewise_expected hold indexes into points.",
  "piecewise_cuts names where the path is split before each section is simplified."
 ],
